w: The world in sol- * emn still- ness lay, To hear the an- * gels sing. *
w: O hush the noise, * ye men of strife, And hear the an- * gels sing. *
w: O rest be- side * the wea- ry road, And hear the an- * gels sing. *
w: And the whole world * gives back the song Which now the an- * gels sing. *
